<title>USA: Mentmore won't seek Steel shareholder list.</title>
<headline>Mentmore won't seek Steel shareholder list.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON, W. Va. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel of West Virgina Inc said Thursday said a representative of CPT Holdings Inc has confirmed that Mentmore Holdings Corp is not pursing the lawsuit that it borught in Delaware to obtain a copy of Steel's shareholder list.</p>
<p>The company said neither CPT nor Mentmore was a stockholder of record when the lawsuit began.</p>
<p>Steel of West Virginia makes special steel products for use in truck trailers, industrial fork lifts, off-highway construction equipment such as bulldozers and grader and guard rail posts.</p>
</text>
